{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "生成音乐",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "根据灵感描述或自定义歌词生成完整歌曲，适用于歌曲创作、纯音乐和指定风格音乐生成。\n\n`custom` 决定字段是否生效：写了但模式不对的字段会被**静默忽略**（不报错）。`custom=true`（自定义）时 `prompt`（歌词）、`title`、`style`、`negative_tags`、`auto_lyrics`、`persona_id`、`style_weight`、`weirdness_constraint`、`audio_weight` 生效；`custom=false`（灵感）时 `prompt` 作灵感描述，`title`/`style` 及上述自定义字段被忽略。`vocal_gender` 两种模式都生效。\n\n**注意**：`suno-music` 使用 `style` 表示风格标签，而非其他模型的 `tags`。\n\n- 所有 Suno 能力均通过 MAPI 公共提交接口调用；模型由请求体中的 `model` 字段区分。\n- 提交成功后立即返回 MAPI 公开任务 ID。请通过 `GET /v1/music/generations/{task_id}` 轮询任务状态。\n- `version` 是平台在提交阶段**强制校验的必填字段**，不传直接返回 400。\n- `custom=false` 或省略时为灵感模式，`prompt` 必填（作为灵感描述）；`custom=true` 时为自定义模式，`instrumental=false` 时 `prompt` 必填（作为歌词），`instrumental=true` 时可省略。\n- 模式不匹配的字段会被上游静默忽略，不会报错。\n- 音乐生成通常需要 30–120 秒，建议每 3–5 秒查询一次公共任务接口。"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "音频（Audio）/Suno"
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "使用 MAPI Bearer Token 认证。格式：`Authorization: Bearer sk-xxxxxx`。"
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/v1/music/generations": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "音频（Audio）/Suno"
        ],
        "summary": "生成音乐",
        "description": "根据灵感描述或自定义歌词生成完整歌曲，适用于歌曲创作、纯音乐和指定风格音乐生成。\n\n`custom` 决定字段是否生效：写了但模式不对的字段会被**静默忽略**（不报错）。`custom=true`（自定义）时 `prompt`（歌词）、`title`、`style`、`negative_tags`、`auto_lyrics`、`persona_id`、`style_weight`、`weirdness_constraint`、`audio_weight` 生效；`custom=false`（灵感）时 `prompt` 作灵感描述，`title`/`style` 及上述自定义字段被忽略。`vocal_gender` 两种模式都生效。\n\n**注意**：`suno-music` 使用 `style` 表示风格标签，而非其他模型的 `tags`。\n\n- 所有 Suno 能力均通过 MAPI 公共提交接口调用；模型由请求体中的 `model` 字段区分。\n- 提交成功后立即返回 MAPI 公开任务 ID。请通过 `GET /v1/music/generations/{task_id}` 轮询任务状态。\n- `version` 是平台在提交阶段**强制校验的必填字段**，不传直接返回 400。\n- `custom=false` 或省略时为灵感模式，`prompt` 必填（作为灵感描述）；`custom=true` 时为自定义模式，`instrumental=false` 时 `prompt` 必填（作为歌词），`instrumental=true` 时可省略。\n- 模式不匹配的字段会被上游静默忽略，不会报错。\n- 音乐生成通常需要 30–120 秒，建议每 3–5 秒查询一次公共任务接口；生成中状态为 `pending`，`progress` 值排队约 10、就绪约 50、完成为 100。\n- 完成后在 `data.result.music[]` 取 `audio_url`（另有 `image_url`、`video_url`、`title`、`duration` 等字段）。\n- 失败时 `data.error.message` 为原因，平台自动退回预扣额度。",
        "operationId": "suno-music",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "const": "suno-music",
                    "description": "固定填写 `suno-music`。",
                    "examples": [
                      "suno-music"
                    ]
                  },
                  "version": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "生成版本：`v3.5` / `v4` / `v4.5` / `v4.5+` / `v4.5-all` / `v5` / `v5.5`，影响音质与计费。**两种模式下均必填，不传直接返回 400**。",
                    "examples": [
                      "v5"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "v3.5",
                      "v4",
                      "v4.5",
                      "v4.5+",
                      "v4.5-all",
                      "v5",
                      "v5.5"
                    ]
                  },
                  "custom": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "description": "`false` 为灵感模式，`prompt` 作为灵感描述；`true` 为自定义模式，`prompt` 作为歌词。默认 `false`。",
                    "default": false
                  },
                  "instrumental": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "description": "`true` 表示生成纯音乐、无人声；默认 `false`。",
                    "default": false
                  },
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "灵感提示词或歌词。`custom=false` 时必填（作灵感描述）；`custom=true` 时：`instrumental=false` 则必填（作歌词），`instrumental=true` 可不填。**缺失时提交期直接返回 400（不扣费）**。"
                  },
                  "title": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "歌曲标题。仅 `custom=true` 时生效，灵感模式下静默忽略。"
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "歌曲风格标签。仅 `custom=true` 时生效；本模型使用 `style`，不是 `tags`。"
                  },
                  "negative_tags": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "不希望出现的风格标签。仅 `custom=true` 时生效。"
                  },
                  "auto_lyrics": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "description": "是否对输入歌词进行二次创作。仅 `custom=true` 时生效。"
                  },
                  "persona_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Persona 风格 ID。仅 `custom=true` 时生效。"
                  },
                  "vocal_gender": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "人声性别。支持 `Male`、`Female` 以及 `m`、`f`、`male`、`female`，两种生成模式均生效。",
                    "examples": [
                      "Female"
                    ],
                    "enum": [
                      "Male",
                      "Female",
                      "m",
                      "f",
                      "male",
                      "female"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style_weight": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 1,
                    "description": "风格权重，范围 0.00–1.00。仅 `custom=true` 时生效。"
                  },
                  "weirdness_constraint": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 1,
                    "description": "创意度，范围 0.00–1.00。仅 `custom=true` 时生效。"
                  },
                  "audio_weight": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 1,
                    "description": "音频权重，范围 0.00–1.00。仅 `custom=true` 时生效。"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "model",
                  "version"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "suno-music-inspiration": {
                  "summary": "灵感模式（自动生成歌词和风格）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "suno-music",
                    "version": "v5",
                    "custom": false,
                    "prompt": "深夜城市 lo-fi 钢琴配雨声"
                  }
                },
                "suno-music-custom": {
                  "summary": "自定义模式（指定歌词和风格）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "suno-music",
                    "version": "v5",
                    "custom": true,
                    "prompt": "[Verse]\n星光洒落在深夜的街\n[Chorus]\n我们一起走过那些年",
                    "title": "深夜星光",
                    "style": "pop, piano, melancholic",
                    "negative_tags": "heavy metal, aggressive",
                    "vocal_gender": "Female"
                  }
                },
                "suno-music-instrumental": {
                  "summary": "纯音乐模式（无人声）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "suno-music",
                    "version": "v5",
                    "custom": true,
                    "instrumental": true,
                    "style": "lofi, piano, rain, chill"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务提交成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "code": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "examples": [
                        200
                      ]
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "examples": [
                        "success"
                      ]
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "status": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "submitted"
                            ]
                          },
                          "task_id": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "MAPI 公开任务 ID，用于公共查询接口。",
                            "examples": [
                              "task_aehCmxJ5YUNOIQGgkhvxaco4T9P2h3Dw"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "status",
                          "task_id"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "code",
                    "data"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "code": 200,
                  "message": "success",
                  "data": [
                    {
                      "status": "submitted",
                      "task_id": "task_aehCmxJ5YUNOIQGgkhvxaco4T9P2h3Dw"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误、模型版本不支持或源任务无效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "code": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "错误代码",
                      "examples": [
                        "invalid_request"
                      ]
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "错误说明"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "description": "错误附加数据，可为空"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "code",
                    "message"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "code": "invalid_request",
                  "message": "task_id is required",
                  "data": null
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
